=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> twice. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>So, to get the correct formula for <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"10.291ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 4430.9 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">P(A\\cup B),</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMAIN-222A\" d=\"M591 598H592Q604 598 611 583V376Q611 345 611 296Q610 162 606 148Q605 146 605 145Q586 68 507 23T333 -22Q268 -22 209 -1T106 66T56 173Q55 180 55 384L56 585Q66 598 75 598Q85 598 95 585V378L96 172L98 162Q112 95 181 57T332 18Q415 18 487 58T570 175Q571 180 571 383V583Q579 598 591 598Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMATHI-42\" d=\"M231 637Q204 637 199 638T194 649Q194 676 205 682Q206 683 335 683Q594 683 608 681Q671 671 713 636T756 544Q756 480 698 429T565 360L555 357Q619 348 660 311T702 219Q702 146 630 78T453 1Q446 0 242 0Q42 0 39 2Q35 5 35 10Q35 17 37 24Q42 43 47 45Q51 46 62 46H68Q95 46 128 49Q142 52 147 61Q150 65 219 339T288 628Q288 635 231 637ZM649 544Q649 574 634 600T585 634Q578 636 493 637Q473 637 451 637T416 636H403Q388 635 384 626Q382 622 352 506Q352 503 351 500L320 374H401Q482 374 494 376Q554 386 601 434T649 544ZM595 229Q595 273 572 302T512 336Q506 337 429 337Q311 337 310 336Q310 334 293 263T258 122L240 52Q240 48 252 48T333 46Q422 46 429 47Q491 54 543 105T595 229Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMAIN-29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"751\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"1141\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-222A\" x=\"2113\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHI-42\" x=\"3003\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"3762\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"4152\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> we need to subtract <em>one</em> of the intersections.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let's look at a concrete example.</p>\n<!-- Could use this content at a later date.\n\nSuppose  [math]A[/math] and [math]B[/math] are two events in a random experiment.  Given that\n\\[\nP(A)=a, \\quad  P(B)=b, \\quad P(A\\cap B)=i,\n\\] \n\nwhat is [math]P(A\\cup B)?[/math]\n\nLet's draw this information on a Venn diagram.\n\n* We start by placing [math]i[/math] in the region [math]A \\cap B,[/math] where the circles overlap. \n\n* Then we place [math]a-i[/math] in the part of the circle [math]A[/math] that is not included in the overlap. This way, we have\n\\[\nP(A) = (a-i) + i = a.\n\\]\nLikewise, we place [math]b-i[/math] in the part of the circle [math]B[/math] that is not included in the overlap. This way, we have\n\\[\nP(B) = (b-i) + i = b.\n\\]\n\n* Finally, we shade in the region [math]A \\cup B.[/math]\n\nOur Venn diagram looks as follows:\n\n<div id=\"graphic-4201cae7666c2fd370c16183636d77da\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/4201cae7666c2fd370c16183636d77da\" /></div>\n\nTo compute [math]P(A \\cup B),[/math] we add up everything in the shaded region [math]A\\cup B,[/math] and get\n\n\\[\\eqalign{\nP(A \\cup B) &= (a-i) + (b-i)+i\\\\[3pt]\n                    & = a+b-i.\n}\\]\n\n\n-->\n           \n                </div>        \n                    \n            </div>",
